{"id":"event_miraclesnow2_01_e","cat":"event","group":{"id":"ev40004","label":"Eternal Memory"},"label":"Ties that Bind: B","stage":null,"prev":"event_miraclesnow2_01_s","next":"event_miraclesnow2_02_s","speakers":{"syuen":"Syuen","rupee":"Rupee"},"icons":{"syuen":"si_c901_00_s","rupee":"si_c200_00_s"},"lines":[{"id":"event_miraclesnow2_01_e_1","type":"Narration","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_miraclesnow2_01_e_1","text":"In Missilis Industry Headquarters.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":"Office","bgArt":"office","image":null,"bgm":"bgm_story_kneeldownfools","movie":null,"shown":["rupee_w","syuen"],"affinity":null},{"id":"event_miraclesnow2_01_e_2","type":"Speech","speaker":"syuen","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_miraclesnow2_01_e_2","text":"We're still conducting a few basic examinations. It should only take about 5 minutes.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_miraclesnow2_01_e_3","type":"Speech","speaker":"rupee","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_miraclesnow2_01_e_3","text":"You're not doing anything more than that, right?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_miraclesnow2_01_e_4","type":"Speech","speaker":"syuen","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_miraclesnow2_01_e_4","text":"How many times do I have to repeat myself? Regardless of what you want to do, you'd still have to undergo the examination first.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_miraclesnow2_01_e_5","type":"Speech","speaker":"syuen","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_miraclesnow2_01_e_5","text":"Who said I was gonna crack her skull open like a coconut?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_miraclesnow2_01_e_6","type":"Speech","speaker":"rupee","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_miraclesnow2_01_e_6","text":"What about everything else that I requested?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_miraclesnow2_01_e_7","type":"Speech","speaker":"syuen","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_miraclesnow2_01_e_7","text":"*Sigh* Lord, give me strength...","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_miraclesnow2_01_e_8","type":"Speech","speaker":"syuen","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_miraclesnow2_01_e_8","text":"I've got Christmas carols playing in the background, I arranged for the machine to make goofy noises that won't scare the children, and I put up some sparkling lights. Happy now?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_miraclesnow2_01_e_9","type":"Speech","speaker":"rupee","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_miraclesnow2_01_e_9","text":"That'll do just fine.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_miraclesnow2_01_e_10","type":"Speech","speaker":"syuen","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_miraclesnow2_01_e_10","text":"I must say, this is all rather unexpected. I thought you hated my guts?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_miraclesnow2_01_e_11","type":"Speech","speaker":"syuen","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_miraclesnow2_01_e_11","text":"I'm surprised you came here, of all places, to report this.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_miraclesnow2_01_e_12","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_miraclesnow2_01_e_12","text":"It's not a report. We're asking for help.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_miraclesnow2_01_e_13","type":"Speech","speaker":"syuen","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_miraclesnow2_01_e_13","text":"If it's help you're asking for, shouldn't you be on your knees begging?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_miraclesnow2_01_e_14","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_miraclesnow2_01_e_14","text":"Do I look like I'm here to joke around with you?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_miraclesnow2_01_e_15","type":"Speech","speaker":"syuen","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_miraclesnow2_01_e_15","text":"... Fine. I'd prefer to get down to hard facts myself, too.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_miraclesnow2_01_e_16","type":"Speech","speaker":"syuen","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_miraclesnow2_01_e_16","text":"We'll know the specifics once the exams are done,","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_miraclesnow2_01_e_17","type":"Speech","speaker":"syuen","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_miraclesnow2_01_e_17","text":"but there's a high chance there's something wrong with her NIMPH.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_miraclesnow2_01_e_18","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_miraclesnow2_01_e_18","text":"NIMPH is capable of malfunctioning?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_miraclesnow2_01_e_19","type":"Speech","speaker":"syuen","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_miraclesnow2_01_e_19","text":"Of course. Nobody ever said that NIMPH was perfect.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_miraclesnow2_01_e_20","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_miraclesnow2_01_e_20","text":"Sounds to me like you're uncertain.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_miraclesnow2_01_e_21","type":"Speech","speaker":"syuen","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_miraclesnow2_01_e_21","text":"Uncertain is exactly what I am. It's not like I'm some know-it-all who claims to know everything.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_miraclesnow2_01_e_22","type":"Speech","speaker":"syuen","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_miraclesnow2_01_e_22","text":"Nobody knows for sure where this stuff came from in the first place.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_miraclesnow2_01_e_23","type":"Speech","speaker":"rupee","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_miraclesnow2_01_e_23","text":"??","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_miraclesnow2_01_e_24","type":"Narration","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_miraclesnow2_01_e_24","text":"*Beep*","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_miraclesnow2_01_e_25","type":"Speech","speaker":"syuen","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_miraclesnow2_01_e_25","text":"The results are out.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_miraclesnow2_01_e_26","type":"Speech","speaker":"syuen","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_miraclesnow2_01_e_26","text":"Let's see...","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_miraclesnow2_01_e_27","type":"Speech","speaker":"syuen","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_miraclesnow2_01_e_27","text":"Mmm, as I expected. \"A temporary malfunction of the NIMPH.\"","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_miraclesnow2_01_e_28","type":"Speech","speaker":"rupee","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_miraclesnow2_01_e_28","text":"So what do we do?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_miraclesnow2_01_e_29","type":"Speech","speaker":"syuen","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_miraclesnow2_01_e_29","text":"It should be all right if we leave it alone. NIMPH has self-healing properties.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_miraclesnow2_01_e_30","type":"Speech","speaker":"rupee","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_miraclesnow2_01_e_30","text":"... But how long will that take?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_miraclesnow2_01_e_31","type":"Speech","speaker":"syuen","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_miraclesnow2_01_e_31","text":"Beats me. It's up to the NIMPH.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_miraclesnow2_01_e_32","type":"Speech","speaker":"rupee","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_miraclesnow2_01_e_32","text":"Not exactly the response I'd expect from a professional...","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_miraclesnow2_01_e_33","type":"Speech","speaker":"syuen","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_miraclesnow2_01_e_33","text":"Look here. I'm doing you a favor by coming in here during the holidays to run these tests.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_miraclesnow2_01_e_34","type":"Speech","speaker":"syuen","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_miraclesnow2_01_e_34","text":"I'm mainly doing this because I don't want a defective product going haywire.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_miraclesnow2_01_e_35","type":"Speech","speaker":"syuen","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_miraclesnow2_01_e_35","text":"Since the tests indicated that it's just a temporary malfunction, it won't be a major issue.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_miraclesnow2_01_e_36","type":"Speech","speaker":"syuen","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_miraclesnow2_01_e_36","text":"What more do you want from me?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_miraclesnow2_01_e_37","type":"Speech","speaker":"syuen","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_miraclesnow2_01_e_37","text":"She'll be here soon enough. When she does, take her and scram.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_miraclesnow2_01_e_38","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_miraclesnow2_01_e_38","text":"One more question.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_miraclesnow2_01_e_39","type":"Speech","speaker":"syuen","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_miraclesnow2_01_e_39","text":"*Sigh* What now?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_miraclesnow2_01_e_40","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_miraclesnow2_01_e_40","text":"Do you know anything about Anne's family?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_miraclesnow2_01_e_41","type":"Speech","speaker":"syuen","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_miraclesnow2_01_e_41","text":"...","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_miraclesnow2_01_e_42","type":"Speech","speaker":"syuen","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_miraclesnow2_01_e_42","text":"Her family?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_miraclesnow2_01_e_43","type":"Speech","speaker":"syuen","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_miraclesnow2_01_e_43","text":"What do you mean?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_miraclesnow2_01_e_44","type":"Speech","speaker":"syuen","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_miraclesnow2_01_e_44","text":"You do realize what happens when a Nikke meets their family members, don't you?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_miraclesnow2_01_e_45","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_miraclesnow2_01_e_45","text":"We know.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_miraclesnow2_01_e_46","type":"Speech","speaker":"syuen","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_miraclesnow2_01_e_46","text":"Then why are you asking me that? What kind of person are you?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_miraclesnow2_01_e_47","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_miraclesnow2_01_e_47","text":"We've made our decision. Just tell us what you know.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_miraclesnow2_01_e_48","type":"Speech","speaker":"syuen","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_miraclesnow2_01_e_48","text":"...","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_miraclesnow2_01_e_49","type":"Speech","speaker":"syuen","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_miraclesnow2_01_e_49","text":"You really sure you're ready for what's going to come?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_miraclesnow2_01_e_50","type":"Speech","speaker":"syuen","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_miraclesnow2_01_e_50","text":"... Forget it. Do what you want.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_miraclesnow2_01_e_51","type":"Speech","speaker":"syuen","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_miraclesnow2_01_e_51","text":"Her mother should still be alive. I'll send you the necessary information. Happy hunting.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_miraclesnow2_01_e_52","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_miraclesnow2_01_e_52","text":"That was easy. A little too easy...","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_miraclesnow2_01_e_53","type":"Speech","speaker":"syuen","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_miraclesnow2_01_e_53","text":"If you don't want the information, that's fine with me.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_miraclesnow2_01_e_54","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_miraclesnow2_01_e_54","text":"...","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_miraclesnow2_01_e_55","type":"Speech","speaker":"syuen","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_miraclesnow2_01_e_55","text":"You always need to chime in with a little snide remark, don't you? A simple \"Thank you\" would suffice.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_miraclesnow2_01_e_56","type":"Narration","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_miraclesnow2_01_e_56","text":"*Beep*","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_miraclesnow2_01_e_57","type":"Speech","speaker":"syuen","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_miraclesnow2_01_e_57","text":"She's waiting for you at the entrance. Now, if you wouldn't mind, get lost.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_miraclesnow2_01_e_58","type":"Speech","speaker":"rupee","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_miraclesnow2_01_e_58","text":"For you.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_miraclesnow2_01_e_59","type":"Monologue","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_miraclesnow2_01_e_59","text":"Rupee hands Syuen a small box.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_miraclesnow2_01_e_60","type":"Speech","speaker":"syuen","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_miraclesnow2_01_e_60","text":"What's this?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_miraclesnow2_01_e_61","type":"Speech","speaker":"rupee","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_miraclesnow2_01_e_61","text":"A seasonal cake from this pâtisserie I frequent.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_miraclesnow2_01_e_62","type":"Speech","speaker":"syuen","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_miraclesnow2_01_e_62","text":"...","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_miraclesnow2_01_e_63","type":"Speech","speaker":"rupee","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_miraclesnow2_01_e_63","text":"It doesn't feel right to come empty-handed on Christmas.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_miraclesnow2_01_e_64","type":"Speech","speaker":"syuen","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_miraclesnow2_01_e_64","text":"Take it back. I'm not eating this garbage.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_miraclesnow2_01_e_65","type":"Speech","speaker":"rupee","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_miraclesnow2_01_e_65","text":"I'll set it on the table. You really ought to try it. It's delicious.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_miraclesnow2_01_e_66","type":"Monologue","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_miraclesnow2_01_e_66","text":"Rupee and I leave Syuen's room.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null}]}